# 🔍 Performance Benchmarking of Lexical vs. Dense Vector IR Models (Quranic Corpus)

A comprehensive performance benchmarking project comparing lexical and dense vector Information Retrieval (IR) models using a Quranic text dataset.

---

### 💡 Project Overview
This project evaluates and compares five different information retrieval models across eight diverse benchmark queries (including exact Arabic words, phrases, meaning-based queries, misspelled words, and English queries). The core objective is to analyze the trade-offs between speed, indexing overhead, and query coverage across lexical and semantic search architectures.

